            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jennifer Steinke Rowan"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I'm doing this for the spaghetti dinner I'm hosting this evening for our high school girls soccer team. There will be anywhere from 20-38 girls and there's no way I could keep the spaghetti cooking fresh quickly enough for them. They like to come in, eat, and get out again, usually all are gone within the hour. This application is perfect for this situation!! Every day meals, no not really, but it's ideal for this.",
